# Safety net only. Every image build sets its context to the app directory
# (see .github/workflows/*.yml and infra/docker-compose.yml), and each app keeps
# its own .dockerignore. This file exists so that an accidental root-context
# build does not ship the entire monorepo into an image layer.

.git
.github
docs
load-testing

**/node_modules
**/.next
**/build
**/dist
**/.gradle
**/.terraform
**/*.tfstate*
**/.env
**/.env.*
